      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start but it feels very focused on europe and greece. wasn't there a lot more going on in other parts of the world at the same time? like, did any other cultures play a major role in things like math, medicine, or how they ran their empires? i dont want my paper to be too one-sided.",
